adamic: /workspace/adamic/internal/oracle/testdata/generic_function_value_arms.a:3:61: Adamic 0.1 refuses a function taking T seen as one taking string (tsc relates a method's parameters both ways), so it can be handed what it can't take; write the method as a property holding a function (handle: (animal: Animal) => void), which tsc checks one way, or take the wider type in the method (method-signature-style)
